      statement: "40 of 84 analysis_runs report files_analyzed=0 but duration_ms>0; total time consumed by file-less passes = ~7600ms of 92800ms total (8.2% of analysis time has no file-level provenance). Largest offenders: pyffi-linker (4570ms), di-resolution (2550ms), method-call-recovery (364ms), annotation-convention-linker (247ms)"  # 27a6
      root_cause: "Synthesis/linker passes that operate on prior IR (not files) report files_analyzed=0 because their input is the in-memory graph, not files. But this conflates 'pass did not run' with 'pass ran on the graph'. Extends UUU (which covered the 8 worst offenders) to the broader 40-pass pattern"  # 27a6
